WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.250
- All right, y'all,
let's close out the hour

00:00:02.250 --> 00:00:04.760
with something delightful from
the world of social media.

00:00:04.760 --> 00:00:06.124
This is what I'm liking.

00:00:06.124 --> 00:00:08.624
(funky music)

00:00:09.740 --> 00:00:11.410
Everyone loves miniature stuff.

00:00:11.410 --> 00:00:12.750
It's just fun and it's cool.

00:00:12.750 --> 00:00:16.220
Doll houses, train sets,
perhaps even a diorama.

00:00:16.220 --> 00:00:18.480
Well, an artist in
California has gone viral

00:00:18.480 --> 00:00:22.690
for her itsy bitsy recreations
of movie and TV sets.

00:00:22.690 --> 00:00:24.132
These are so cool.

00:00:24.132 --> 00:00:27.740
Here's her version of Monica's
apartment from Friends,

00:00:27.740 --> 00:00:29.817
which is incredible.

00:00:29.817 --> 00:00:33.893
And this is the comic bookstore
from The Big Bang Theory.

00:00:35.240 --> 00:00:37.070
Like how much time?

00:00:37.070 --> 00:00:39.010
This is the bedroom from ET.

00:00:39.010 --> 00:00:44.010
And here, here is actually
Jerry's apartment from Seinfeld.

00:00:44.030 --> 00:00:46.510
She's got all the greats
in there, that was amazing.

00:00:46.510 --> 00:00:48.580
She's so gifted, so talented.

00:00:48.580 --> 00:00:49.460
Let's get her in here.

00:00:49.460 --> 00:00:51.477
Say hi to Bridget, y'all.

00:00:51.477 --> 00:00:55.032
(audience cheers)

00:00:55.032 --> 00:00:58.032
So, the details are insane in these.

00:00:59.320 --> 00:01:01.928
Like, first of all, how
long does making these take

00:01:01.928 --> 00:01:05.150
and also do you make everything by hand?

00:01:05.150 --> 00:01:07.956
- Yeah, I pretty much make
just about everything.

00:01:07.956 --> 00:01:12.150
They could take me three weeks
to a month to two months.

00:01:12.150 --> 00:01:14.400
Just depends how big they are, their size.

00:01:14.400 --> 00:01:18.190
Some of the details are very
intricate, like the comic books

00:01:18.190 --> 00:01:21.830
and the cereal boxes
for Jerry's apartment.

00:01:21.830 --> 00:01:23.560
I like getting all of the props

00:01:23.560 --> 00:01:27.210
to match what the sitcom
has on them or the movie,

00:01:27.210 --> 00:01:29.480
because I'm really obsessed with details

00:01:29.480 --> 00:01:31.068
if you haven't noticed.

00:01:31.068 --> 00:01:31.901
- [Kelly] Amen.

00:01:31.901 --> 00:01:33.340
- I've been obsessed since I was a kid.

00:01:33.340 --> 00:01:35.750
My grandma used to collect miniatures

00:01:35.750 --> 00:01:37.530
and she said no touching.

00:01:37.530 --> 00:01:39.500
So of course, when you
tell a kid no touching

00:01:39.500 --> 00:01:41.530
they become more obsessed.

00:01:41.530 --> 00:01:43.790
And I've been doing this my whole life.

00:01:43.790 --> 00:01:46.320
Even throughout college, I
couldn't focus on schoolwork.

00:01:46.320 --> 00:01:49.210
I just had to get to that
doll house when I got home,

00:01:49.210 --> 00:01:51.890
because it was just burning inside of me.

00:01:51.890 --> 00:01:53.540
- Because someone told
you not to touch it.

00:01:53.540 --> 00:01:55.610
It's just who we are. (laughs)

00:01:55.610 --> 00:01:56.890
So, I have a question.

00:01:56.890 --> 00:01:58.470
I heard that celebrities are reaching out

00:01:58.470 --> 00:02:01.210
'cause they want one of their own, right?

00:02:01.210 --> 00:02:03.100
- Yeah, I've been so surprised.

00:02:03.100 --> 00:02:06.180
I saw, I opened up my TikTok

00:02:06.180 --> 00:02:08.387
and I see John Stamos asked a question,

00:02:08.387 --> 00:02:10.450
"Can you make a Full House mini?"

00:02:10.450 --> 00:02:12.020
And I had to check twice

00:02:12.020 --> 00:02:14.160
to make sure that was his
real account and it was,

00:02:14.160 --> 00:02:15.540
so I was shocked.

00:02:15.540 --> 00:02:18.240
I said, yes, and I'm working on it now.

00:02:18.240 --> 00:02:19.820
So this is a work in progress.

00:02:19.820 --> 00:02:22.620
It's a big build, but I'm
really excited about it.

00:02:22.620 --> 00:02:24.616
I can't wait to show everybody.

00:02:24.616 --> 00:02:25.449
- That's so cool.

00:02:25.449 --> 00:02:27.430
And it's so special what
you're doing for people.

00:02:27.430 --> 00:02:30.640
It's such a unique talent
and it takes so much time.

00:02:30.640 --> 00:02:31.700
It's gotta be so meticulous.

00:02:31.700 --> 00:02:34.050
Congratulations on just being awesome.

00:02:34.050 --> 00:02:35.340
It's amazing what you do.

00:02:35.340 --> 00:02:37.243
I'm liking your post right now, Bridget.

00:02:37.243 --> 00:02:40.555
(audience cheers)

00:02:40.555 --> 00:02:41.490
And that's not all.

00:02:41.490 --> 00:02:43.310
Our season-long partner Pilot Pen,

00:02:43.310 --> 00:02:45.190
makers of Friction, the go-to erasable pen

00:02:45.190 --> 00:02:46.440
of the Kelly Clarkson Show,

00:02:46.440 --> 00:02:48.590
want to celebrate those
creating fearlessly

00:02:48.590 --> 00:02:51.860
and just creating as amazing as you do,

00:02:51.860 --> 00:02:53.590
so they're gonna give you $1,000.

00:02:53.590 --> 00:02:54.516
How's that sound?

00:02:54.516 --> 00:02:55.851
(audience cheers)

00:02:55.851 --> 00:02:57.015
- Oh, great.

00:02:57.015 --> 00:02:58.450
I'm gonna spend that on minis.

00:02:58.450 --> 00:02:59.730
- [Kelly] I love it, I love it.

00:02:59.730 --> 00:03:01.893
Well, thank you so much, Bridget.

